        <section id="the-importance-of-communication"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
            <h2>The importance of communication</h2>
              <p>Communication involves passing information from one person to another and in turn understanding that information. Communication skills are a necessary part of life and are required both in the workplace and in personal interactions.</p>

              
              
<div class="gallery-container">
  <div role="group" class="gallery no-js">
    <ul>
        <li role="listitem">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Communicating in business
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>In all businesses we spend our days communicating verbally, non-verbally and in written form by various methods such as by emails, meetings, conference calls, creating and sending reports, giving presentations, and by general face to face discussion. To do this effectively we need to make sure that our communication is clear, concise and accurate.</p>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s1_p2_slide1.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </li>
        <li role="listitem">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Why communication is important in a coding environment
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>The skill of communication is important in coding and programming as often the information that needs to be communicated is highly technical and not everyone involved in the process has the same technical knowledge or may be conversant with the terminology and coding languages used.</p>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s1_p2_slide2.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </li>
        <li role="listitem">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Importance of effective communication when working in a team
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>Clear, concise communication is fundamental to the success of project management and those working in a coding environment as it is essential that teams collaborate effectively when striving to achieve successful results. Poor communication can lead to unnecessary costs to put things right.</p>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s1_p2_slide3.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

            
          
