              <h3>Adapting communication for different audiences</h3>
<p>Please see the following video on the importance of adapting communication for different audiences.</p>

              <!-- sections.njk VIDEO! -->
              
              
              
      <div class="l-video-container">
        <video poster="~/images/svg/poster.svg" controls preload="metadata" aria-labelledby="watch" width="1000"
